      "side": 1,
      "message": "This isn\u0027t quite clear to me. allow_expired_window is additive, so if we want keys to be around long enough to validate a token that has expired, then token_expiration in the formula needs to be ``[token]/expiration`` + ``[token]/allow_expired_window``. In that case it\u0027s unclear to use \"token_expiration\" in the formula, maybe we should use \"maximum_validation_window\", and move this note up in the page so it is closer to where the formula is defined.",
